 characters who will open up to you as you progress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating story that will take you deeper into the hearts of your visitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm and cosy atmosphere in your caravan, despite the looming disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 puzzles to help you solve and understand the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 hours of immersive play and reading.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938770/extras/41a2102c91ac62d182c30a781484d7cf.avif?t=1750147410\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You arrive in a small village as a fortune-teller who reads the future in tea leaves. But an apocalyptic vision leads you to question its tranquillity. What if you had a part to play in this? Ready your cups and tea leaves, as the future of this village will be shaped by four unusual visitors.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938770/e8018d2dab5f075585d3315d4c0f9072ca02cc39/header.jpg?t=1750147410", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938770/359590bc81041d0fcd29f873637641e1cb50ba05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750147410", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938770/359590bc81041d0fcd29f873637641e1cb50ba05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750147410", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB display memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}